# LaTeX build artifacts.
#
# The pdf/-scoped rules below were the original; they are kept because that
# directory may still be used, but they only ever matched inside pdf/ while
# every .tex in this repo lives at the ROOT -- so .aux/.log/.out have been
# accumulating untracked at top level the whole time. Rules below are
# unscoped, which is what the predicate "ignore LaTeX byproducts" actually
# wants (found 2026-10-04).
#
# NOTE, and this matters: in THIS repo *.out is a hyperref byproduct sitting
# beside a .tex, so ignoring it is correct. In proofs/ the same extension is
# ALSO my convention for computational evidence logs under code-*/, which must
# NOT be ignored -- see proofs/.gitignore. Same extension, opposite meaning,
# two repos. Do not copy either rule into the other.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz

pdf/*.aux
pdf/*.log
pdf/*.out
pdf/*.toc
